<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Morgan upgrades First Bank System.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Morgan upgrades First Bank System.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley analyst David Hilder said he upgraded First Bank System Inc to buy from an outperform rating.</p>
<p>-- said First Bank should be able the achieve its planned cost cutting targets from its merger with U.S. Bancorp.</p>
<p>-- set 12-month target price $95.</p>
<p>-- raised 1998 earnings estimate to $6.15 a share from $6.05.</p>
<p>-- set 1999 earnings estimate $7.30 a share.</p>
</text>
